From: Ambient <eng@ambient.ai>
Date: Thu, 4 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Drop the legacy stats sweep from ApplyLocalDescription

Same sweep, same reader: a legacy getStats(), which runs its own UpdateStats on
call. Measured 32.5% of ApplyLocalDescription, 1,047 ms worst.

---
diff -ruN a/pc/peer_connection.cc b/pc/peer_connection.cc
--- a/pc/peer_connection.cc	2026-09-04 15:21:17.639840450 +0000
+++ b/pc/peer_connection.cc	2026-09-04 15:21:18.053254786 +0000
@@ -2643,9 +2643,8 @@
   RTC_DCHECK_RUN_ON(signaling_thread());
   RTC_DCHECK(desc);
 
-  // Update stats here so that we have the most recent stats for tracks and
-  // streams that might be removed by updating the session description.
-  stats_->UpdateStats(kStatsOutputLevelStandard);
+  // Legacy stats sweep removed: the only reader is a legacy getStats(), which runs
+  // its own UpdateStats on call.
 
   // Take a reference to the old local description since it's used below to
   // compare against the new local description. When setting the new local
--
2.34.1
